cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Online active-catalyst estimation and fault-tolerant nonlinear model predictive control for batch biodiesel production: code and data"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Apollo-Eng-Ltd/catalyst-state-ftc-biodiesel"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a simulation study of a K2CO3-catalysed batch
  transesterification reactor with feedstock and equipment faults: the plant
  model and its fit to experimental yields, the fault dataset, fault detection
  and classification, a recurrent catalyst-state estimator with an EKF
  baseline, an economic NMPC with a split-conformal stop rule, the Monte Carlo
  comparison and a Simulink version of the closed loop.
keywords:
  - biodiesel
  - catalyst-state estimation
  - fault-tolerant control
  - nonlinear model predictive control
  - conformal prediction
  - Simulink
